  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Changed:\n            - Updated dependency to **Knight.Response.Abstractions.Http 2.0.0-preview01**.\n            - Updated service registration:\n            • Removed post-configuration of validation mapper.\n            • Now uses TryAddScoped<IValidationErrorMapper, DefaultValidationErrorMapper> so existing registrations are preserved.\n            • Custom mappers can be registered via AddKnightResponse<TMapper> overload.\n            - Mapper resolution moved into ProblemFactory with runtime fallback:\n            1) RequestServices (per-request DI scope).\n            2) Options.ValidationMapper override.\n            3) New DefaultValidationErrorMapper instance.\n\n            Breaking changes:\n            - Default behavior aligned with Knight.Response.Abstractions.Http 2.0.0-preview01:\n            • UseProblemDetails = false\n            • UseValidationProblemDetails = false\n            • IncludeFullResultPayload = false (was true in 0.1.0)\n            • IncludeExceptionDetails = false\n            - Mapper is no longer pre-bound on options and is resolved per-request.",
